    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669600/extras/315f2117a9dd2fcd0ba501a64607ff83.avif?t=1718032415\" /></div><br>In a dystopian future marked by extreme weather and destroyed by human wars, a group of scientists embark on an expedition to revitalize a deserted area. After installing measuring instruments, a terrible disaster occurs and the team disappears. A few years later, another team is sent to the same location to recover the instruments and uncover clues about the previous team.<br><br>It is during this mission that Cytra, an young scientist, seeks the answers she needs while dreaming of a future with a new green world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669600/extras/2d081eb8918552ddf419e42145eba24d.avif?t=1718032415\" /></div><br>The world as we once knew no longer exists; an unwary person might think we're on Mars or another desolated planet. A significant portion of what remains of humanity now resides in isolated autonomous cities and frequently sends expeditions to attempt to restore habitability to devastated regions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669600/extras/b8f688d90cfcead4d4b9c2ee735e7671.avif?t=1718032415\" /></div><br>Survive the extreme weather or use it to your advantage. Weather conditions have unique effects on the environment and are closely related to survival mechanics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669600/extras/a1ab280d3270544f9aebae6b22f57b9b.avif?t=1718032415\" /></div><br>Green Memories is an action RPG with sandbox and shooter elements, featuring beautiful pixel art and chiptune soundtrack inspired by other retro games.",
